// config/axioms.dbv — Axiom Facility settings (plan 2026-08-26-axiom-facility.md)
// House rule (2026-08-27): human-editable config uses structured .dbv
// (schema'd, parse_document_quoted); machine-generated tuning tables use
// flat .dbvl (ConfigDb). This file is human-editable → .dbv.
//
// Declared-authority enforcement dial. `axiom` marks knowledge taken on
// authority instead of proof (SPEC §8.7): axiomatic cast edges, authoritative
// contract posts.
//
// policy: allow | warn | deny — how declared axiom sites are treated.
//   allow: accepted; one info line per site in the warnings stream.
//   warn:  accepted; a prominent warning naming every site rides alongside.
//   deny:  any axiom site is a hard error — prove it or remove the shortcut.
// The .s strict report always renders the full ledger regardless of this.
//
// 2026-09-22 (syntax-cleanup plan): the lemma_properties vocabulary is
// removed. Op lemmas were dead on arrival — no parser accepted the grammar,
// no pass consumed the rights, and float reassociation is already granted by
// -ffast-math + !> associative. axiom on cast edges remains the sole
// authority mechanism (justified: FFI impls have no Briev body to prove).

schema AxiomSettings {
    policy: String;
};

as AxiomSettings {
    policy: allow;
};